=======
CHANGES
=======

-------------
v1.0.0-beta.1
-------------

V1.0 beta1 源码基线（2026-11-01）：固化五批修复（数据粘贴与精度、统计核心、DOE 工作流、比例检验与过程能力、文件安全与 Windows 启动），以及后续嵌入式控制图与泊松分布返回结果修复；本轮仅同步版本元数据、必要测试与发布记录，不改变已验收功能。

产品版本/本地 annotated tag 为 v1.0.0-beta.1，Windows 四段版本 1.0.0.1，发行包代号 V1.0-beta1，产物前缀 MiniJMP-V1.0-beta1。本版未构建 Windows EXE/ZIP，未推送或发布。后续构建须先同步远端以满足 HEAD == origin/main，再重新构建运行包与对应源码包。

旧 AnimateOptions 可见动画的后台线程/Tk Canvas 风险尚未单独整改；实际 PI Server、办公端 Defender/TsdEncrypt、无管理员权限与现场部署均未验收。本次不表示原 64/26 项问题全部关闭。各项修复细节见 docs/CHANGELOG_DEV.md，历史 beta.4 构建证据保持原样。

-------------
v0.1.0-beta.4
-------------

pandas 3.0.6 兼容性与数据完整性增强：改进表格编辑、CSV/Excel 高精度导入、PI 数据精度、分类分组及绘图导出。详见 docs/release/v0.1.0-beta.4-release.md。

-------------
v0.1.0-beta.3
-------------

冻结当前源码产品基线：完善通用绘图器的数据列角色、绘图模式与界面交互；补齐工作表公式、剪贴板及工程持久化边界；完成阶段控制图和过程能力对比修复，并处理 pandas 兼容问题。修复 PIReader 在 pandas 2.2.3 下混合整数与缺失值时的大整数精度损失。

Windows 构建工具与版本元数据已同步到 beta.3。此处记录的是源码基线，本轮未生成 Windows EXE 或 ZIP，因此尚无发布包校验值。

-------------
v0.1.0-beta.2
-------------

Beta 2 marks the current source tree: review-driven P0/P1/P2 fixes, a Windows release gate that requires a clean worktree and tracked build inputs, and the read-only precheck (tools/check_windows_release_ready.ps1). No EXE or ZIP has been built for this version yet.

Release tooling aligned with the office environment: Windows x64 with Python >= 3.11,
PIReader and its config.txt shipped beside MiniJMP.exe, archives built by
tools/make_zip.py, EXE smoke check via tools/smoke_launch.py, and SHA256SUMS
re-verified after the transparent-encryption settling window. Uncommitted files now
produce a WARNING instead of blocking the build. No EXE or ZIP has been built yet.


-------------
v0.1.0-beta.1
-------------

Windows x64 onedir test build with bundled Python runtime, offline help, and selected sample data.
The source bundle and locked Windows build recipe are distributed alongside the application archive.


------
0.1.0
------

Moved the code from a large repo and cleaned the unnecessary files. The current version has basically all the math and functions done. Next steps are to write readme, optimize interface and add help. While with the new stand alone repo a doc read was connceted to the repo too. 
